    "title": "Hallsville's Walker scores 3 times, Texarkana sweeps doubleheader - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Kyle Owens ,\n11 hours ago TEXARKANA, Texas (KLTV) - Former Hallsville Lady Cat Kamryn Walker crossed the plate three times as Texas A&M-Texarkana swept its doubleheader against Crowley’s Ridge on Tuesday. Texarkana won the first game 5-0 and the second 11-1. In the first game, Walker went 1-for-3 with a run. She scored on... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
